  "sections": [
    {
      "h2": "How the checker works",
      "html": "<p>The checker matches your answers against common legal requirements and the covers lenders, landlords and clients typically expect. It’s deliberately cautious and general: it can’t see your contracts, your lender’s conditions or your exact location, and it isn’t personal advice. Use it as a shortlist, then read each guide and check the policy wording.</p>"
    },
    {
      "h2": "What the labels mean",
      "html": "<ul><li><strong>Legal or lender requirement</strong>: required by law in your region (such as motor or employers’ cover), or almost always required by a lender.</li><li><strong>Strongly consider</strong>: commonly needed for your situation or demanded by clients, leases or landlords.</li><li><strong>Worth a look</strong>: depends on your risks and budget.</li></ul>"
    }
  ],
  "faqs": [
    {
      "q": "Do you store my answers?",
      "a": "No. The checker runs in your browser. Your answers appear in the page address so you can bookmark or share the result, but they aren’t sent to us."
    },
    {
      "q": "Is this financial advice?",
      "a": "No. It’s general information to help you shortlist covers. For complex needs, speak to a regulated broker or adviser."
    }
  ],
